        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/a88e57/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-04-12T14:20:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So issue one is over. I am trying to figure out how to move onto what is next. Do people each want to take a turn posting about what your heroes are up to for the next week?&nbsp;</p><p>Maybe how you come together? Or further investigate and such. Basically, tell me what you would like to do before Issue 2 begins and we will work together to make it work!&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Issue 2 is coming!&nbsp;</p>",
