        "created_at": "2018-04-13T13:17:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I am waiting for Legacy(Character) to make my next move, If not I will post stuff tomorrow based on the info I have. This will act as a Montage scene.&nbsp;<br><br>If anyone else Wants to interact&nbsp;with Amina, She is helpful and wants to make up for shooting at Legacy.<br><br>Legacy101, I would make the villain take a turn in between the heroes if we are taking to long. My favorite part of this game is the initiative.&nbsp;</p>",
