        "created_at": "2018-04-13T19:01:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"VGBM\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/vgbm/48/2020_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> VGBM:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Aw dang, if I knew that was gonna happen, I wouldn't've waited till next round to make my next post. I didn't want to just leave the Wraith hanging like that.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>On the other hand, this is a very \"comics\" cliff-hangar to end on…But I say if we do end the episode there we definately need to hand wave calming Legacy down and figuring out who's taking the unconcious dude the the hospital and how we keep in contact &amp; what not</p>",
