        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/77aa72/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-04-30T22:34:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm not sure if this thing is still going on or not (looks like Legacy102 hasn't been on here in a couple of weeks), but I think I'll have to step away if it is (at least for the time being). Things have been quite hectic at work and an at-home project is also taking up some considerable time. I was also finding the PBF thing a bit hard to follow at times. So, if someone wants to claim Unity, and Legacy102 is OK with it, you have my blessing. If things free up a bit more later on the road and you still have a free spot, I'm open to the idea of coming back, but I don't want to be dragging things down if I can't post as much.</p><p>But have fun! I can't wait to play this RPG IRL. :)</p>",
